WEBVTT

00:25:58.875 --> 00:26:00.351
But maybe a different dynamic.

00:26:00.375 --> 00:26:02.184
EP: To whom, to whom is the question.

00:26:02.208 --> 00:26:03.476
AG: To my wife, mostly.

00:26:03.500 --> 00:26:06.809
Yeah, I think that tracks for me.

00:26:06.833 --> 00:26:09.726
I'm curious then
about the more basic question

00:26:09.750 --> 00:26:11.059
of building trust

00:26:11.083 --> 00:26:12.559
and how you think about that.

00:26:12.583 --> 00:26:14.643
Rachel also changed
my thinking about this.

00:26:14.667 --> 00:26:15.934
She said to me one day,

00:26:15.958 --> 00:26:18.976
"You can't build trust,
you have to earn trust."

00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:21.726
And I was annoyed by that, actually,

00:26:21.750 --> 00:26:25.143
because it took the power
to build trust out of my hands, right?

00:26:25.167 --> 00:26:27.018
That this is not something I can gain.

00:26:27.042 --> 00:26:28.684
It's regardless of what I do,

00:26:28.708 --> 00:26:32.893
you have the choice then
to either grant me trust or deny it.